In 2026, [[Maura Higgins]] competed on [[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series) season 35|season 35]] of ''[[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)|Dancing with the Stars]]''.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Strause |first=Jackie |date=April 22, 2026 |title=''Summer House'' Star Ciara Miller Cast in ''Dancing With the Stars'' Season 35 |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-news/summer-house-ciara-miller-dwts-1236571929/ |access-date=April 27, 2026 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |language=en-US}}</ref> Later, it was revealed that Higgins would be paired with fellow faithful [[Mark Ballas]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Bernabe |first=Angeline Jade |date=September 2, 2026 |title=''Dancing with the Stars'' season 35: Meet the celebrity cast and their pro dance partners |url=https://abcnews.com/GMA/Culture/dancing-with-the-stars-season-35-celebrity-cast/story?id=136095657 |access-date=September 2, 2026 |website=[[Good Morning America]] |publisher=[[ABC News (United States)|ABC News]] |language=en}}</ref>

